&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHY CAPCO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A career at Capco is a chance to help reshape the competitive landscape in financial services. We launch new banks, transform existing ones, and help our clients navigate complex change. As consultants, we work on the front-end business design all the way through to technology implementation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are the largest Financial Services focused consultancy in the world, serving everyone from global banks to emerging FinTechs, from strategy through digital transformation, design, business consulting, data and analytics, cyber, cloud, technology architecture, and engineering.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Capco is a young and growing firm. We maintain an entrepreneurial spirit and growth mindset, and have minimal bureaucracy. We have no internal silos that get in the way of your career opportunities or ability to focus on our clients and make a difference to the business. We offer the opportunity for everyone to learn rapidly, take on tough challenges, and get promoted quickly. We take pride in our creative, collaborative, diverse, and inclusive culture, where everyone can #BYAW.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We offer highly competitive benefits, flexible working hours, technical and soft skills training, smartphone &amp;amp; fast mobile internet and a work culture focused on innovation and creation of lasting value for our clients and employees.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Ready to take the Next Step&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If this sounds like you, we would love to hear from you. &amp;nbsp;This is an opportunity to make a difference and contribute to a highly successful company with a significant growth trajectory.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Summit:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit Therapeutics Inc. is a biopharmaceutical oncology company with a mission focused on improving quality of life, increasing potential duration of life, and resolving serious unmet medical needs. At Summit, we believe in building a team of world class professionals who are passionate about this mission, and it is our people who drive this mission to reality. Summit’s core values include integrity, passion for excellence, purposeful urgency, collaboration, and our commitment to people. Our employees are truly the heart and soul of our culture, and they are invaluable in shaping our journey toward excellence.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit’s team is inspired to touch and help change lives through Summit’s clinical studies in the field of oncology. Summit has multiple global Phase 3 clinical studies, including:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Non-small Cell Lung Cancer (NSCLC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi: Phase 3 clinical study which was intended to evaluate ivonescimab combined with chemotherapy compared to placebo plus chemotherapy in patients with EGFR-mutated, locally advanced or metastatic non-squamous NSCLC who were previously treated with a 3rd generation EGFR TKI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-3: Phase 3 clinical study which is intended to evaluate ivonescimab combined with chemotherapy compared to pembrolizumab combined with chemotherapy in patients with first-line metastatic NSCLC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-7: Phase 3 clinical study which is intended to evaluate ivonescimab monotherapy compared to pembrolizumab monotherapy in patients with first-line metastatic NSCLC.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Colorectal Cancer (CRC)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;HARMONi-GI3: Phase 3 clinical study intended to evaluate ivonescimab in combination with chemotherapy compared with bevacizumab plus chemotherapy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Ivonescimab is an investigational therapy not presently approved by any regulatory authority other than China’s National Medical Products Administration (NMPA). Summit is headquartered in Miami, Florida, and has additional offices in California, New Jersey, the UK, and Ireland.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Job Title: Sr. Medical Science Liaison&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 10.5pt;&quot;&gt;Location: Oxford, UK or Zug, Switzerland or Dublin, Ireland&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview of Role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Associate Director, Clinical Supply Management supports the Senior Director in leading the full scope of global clinical supply chain responsibilities. The role translates functional strategy into disciplined execution across demand and supply planning, inventory management, packaging and labelling, distribution, returns and destruction, cross-border compliance, and GxP operations. Acting as a key delegate for the Senior Director, the (Associate) Director provides a layer of management for direct reports, establishes clear priorities and performance expectations, develops team capability, and drives operational excellence through standardized processes, meaningful metrics, proactive risk management, and continuous improvement. The role partners closely with Clinical Operations, Commercial, CMC, Quality, Regulatory, Finance, Legal, Procurement, Medical Affairs and Program Management, and oversees external partners including Contract Development and Manufacturing Organizations (CDMOs), IXRS providers and specialist service providers.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role and Responsibilities:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports the Senior Director in developing functional strategy, operating plans, budgets, governance and performance objectives across global clinical supply chain activities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads day-to-day execution for new and ongoing studies and products, ensuring robust forecasting, supply planning, schedule adherence, inventory optimization, global logistics and sustained GxP compliance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Serves as a delegate for the Senior Director in cross-functional forums, governance meetings, supplier reviews and issue escalation, providing clear recommendations and ensuring timely follow-through.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages and develops direct reports, translating functional priorities into individual objectives, balancing workloads, coaching performance, supporting career development and ensuring appropriate succession and capability plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Creates an effective management layer by coordinating team activities, reinforcing accountability, removing operational barriers and escalating material risks or decisions to the Senior Director.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Overseeing the Clinical Supply Management (CSM) team, the Associate Director interprets complex clinical protocols, development plans and commercial demand forecasts, working with CMC and internal and external partners to develop packaging, labelling, supply and resupply strategies, timelines and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports the accountability of CSM team to oversee packaging, labelling, release, distribution, resupply, returns, reconciliation and destruction activities across global locations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develops and maintains supply project budgets, resource plans and integrated schedules, monitors performance and proactively resolves variances&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Manages CDMO and service-provider activities from RFP and contracting support through routine operations, troubleshooting, invoicing and performance management using defined KPIs and service expectations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports IXRS selection, design, set-up, User Acceptance Testing (UAT), implementation and ongoing operational performance as required by IRT Management Team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drives operational excellence by defining standard work, governance routines, KPIs and dashboards; uses trend and root-cause analysis to improve service, quality, cost, compliance and team productivity&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leads continuous-improvement initiatives that streamline and harmonize processes, strengthen inspection readiness and embed sustainable ways of working&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Supports regulatory submissions, audits and inspections and ensures timely management of SOPs, change controls, deviations, investigations and CAPAs within the function&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provides continuity of leadership and performs other responsibilities within the function as assigned&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience, Education and Specialized Knowledge and Skills:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;BSc, MSc, engineering or pharmacy degree, or equivalent, with a minimum of 8+ years of progressive supply chain experience in a pharmaceutical, biotechnology or contract development and manufacturing organization (CDMO) environment&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated success leading complex international clinical studies and product supply chains, with broad knowledge of regulatory and GMP requirements for IMP and commercial product packaging and supply&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prior people-management experience, including setting objectives, coaching performance, developing talent, delegating effectively and managing through others&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated ability to translate strategy into executable priorities, operating rhythms, metrics and measurable team outcomes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong operational-excellence and continuous-improvement capability, including process standardization, KPI management, root-cause analysis and sustainable implementation of improvements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid understanding of IXRS design specifications, set-up and UAT, together with proficiency in clinical supply planning and forecasting tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong project, budget, risk and resource-management skills, with the ability to manage multiple priorities while maintaining high-quality results&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expertise in outsourcing, supplier governance, negotiation and performance management&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience building, scaling or improving end-to-end product supply chains and associated business processes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to operate as a trusted deputy to the Director, exercise sound judgement within delegated authority and escalate issues with clear options and recommendations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confident communicator able to influence all levels of the organization and build effective relationships with global colleagues, customers and suppliers&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Able to work independently with complex global problems while fostering inclusion, collaboration, accountability and effective team leadership&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Agile and resilient in a dynamic organization where priorities may change rapidly&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledge of the drug development process and applicable FDA, EMA and PMDA expectations, including GMP, GCP, Annex 13 and relevant clinical trial requirements&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Technically proficient with industry-standard systems and tools and able to use technology, data and industry trends to improve efficiency and decision-making&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Knowledgeable of and compliant with SOPs, change controls, deviations, investigations and CAPAs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;This is the pay for this position&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Pay Transparency&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;$83,000&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;$97,500 USD&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Actual compensation packages are based on several factors that are unique to each candidate, including but not limited to skill set, depth of experience, certifications, and specific work location. This may be different in other locations due to differences in the cost of labor. The total compensation package for this position may also include bonus, stock, benefits and/or other applicable variable compensation.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Summit does not accept referrals from employment businesses and/or employment agencies in respect of the vacancies posted on this site. All employment businesses/agencies are required to contact Summit’s Talent Acquisition team at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a ----- ----- obtain prior written authorization before referring any candidates to Summit.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-teams=&quot;true&quot;&gt;Summit Therapeutics Inc.&amp;nbsp;is an Equal Opportunity Employer and takes pride in creating and maintaining diverse environment. We do not discriminate in recruitment, hiring, training or promotion or any other employment practices for reasons of race, color, religion, gender, national origin, age, sexual orientation, marital or veteran status, disability, or any other legally protected status.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;ABOUT SOTHEBY&#39;S&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Established in 1744, Sotheby’s promotes access and ownership of exceptional art and luxury objects through auctions, private sales and retail. Our deep expertise across 70 selling categories is supported by a leading technology platform and a global network of specialists spanning 40 countries. Selling categories include Contemporary Art, Modern and Impressionist Art, Old Masters, Chinese Works of Art, Jewelry, Watches, Wine and Spirits and Design, as well as collectible cars and real estate through RM Sotheby’s and Concierge. Sotheby’s Financial Services is a leading art lender and provides capital solutions for collectors around the world, having originated more than $12 billion in loans since its inception. Sotheby’s new global headquarters is now open at the iconic Breuer building at 945 Madison Avenue in New York City.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working closely with the Head of Luxury Division and the Managing Director Switzerland, the role provides meaningful business insights, performance visibility and strategic reporting to support decision-making across the business. The position acts as an enabler to specialists and leadership teams by translating commercial and client data into actionable intelligence, helping identify trends, opportunities and areas of focus.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;RESPONSIBILITIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Client Analytics &amp;amp; Growth Insights&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Leverage internal client data and CRM tools to provide visibility on client activity, engagement patterns and growth opportunities across categories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support specialists and leadership teams by identifying client trends, areas of opportunity and potential cross-category connections.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to client acquisition and development initiatives through data-driven analysis and actionable insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse client acquisition, retention and reactivation trends to support business planning and prioritization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop reporting and insights on key client-related KPIs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with global client strategy teams to share best practices and ensure alignment of methodologies and reporting.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Business Performance Analytics &amp;amp; Reporting&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and maintain reporting frameworks, dashboards and KPI tracking tools for the Luxury business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide visibility on performance across auctions, private sales and client development activities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce regular business reviews and performance reporting for the Luxury and Swiss leadership team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor key performance indicators and highlight trends, opportunities and areas requiring attention.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Conduct pre-sale, during-sale and post-sale analyses to support business discussions and future planning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop auction intelligence reporting and market insights to support decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Analyse bidding activity, buyer participation, conversion metrics and international selling patterns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop auction and sales performance reporting on the Luxury and Switzerland&#39;s contribution to the wider Sotheby&#39;s business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex business data into actionable insights and recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Process Improvement, Automation &amp;amp; Data Enablement&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support strategic initiatives aimed at enhancing business visibility, reporting capabilities and operational efficiency.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve reporting processes through automation and AI-enabled solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with P&amp;amp;T teams to improve data accessibility and reporting capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the implementation and adoption of new tools, processes and reporting frameworks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to cross-functional projects requiring coordination, analysis and stakeholder engagement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help reduce manual reporting activities and improve scalability through process optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Leadership Reporting &amp;amp; Communications&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Prepare executive-level presentations, business reviews and strategic updates for Luxury and Swiss leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate complex analyses into clear, concise and actionable business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce materials that support leadership discussions, planning and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop presentation materials for senior management meetings and business reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate communication across functions to ensure alignment on reporting, priorities and objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure stakeholders have timely access to relevant performance, client and market insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;IDEAL EXPERIENCE &amp;amp; COMPETENCIES&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5-8 years’ experience in business analytics, commercial insights, reporting or business intelligence, ideally within luxury, financial services, consulting or a data-driven commercial environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical skills with the ability to translate complex data into clear business recommendations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advanced IT skills; experience with CRM platforms and data visualisation tools.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience building dashboards, KPI frameworks and executive reporting materials.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong business acumen with an interest in client behaviour, sales performance and market trends.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent communication and presentation skills, able to influence and engage senior stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactive, curious and solution-oriented, with a continuous improvement mindset and strong attention to detail.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluent in English. Swiss market exposure preferred.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;To view our &lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/strong&gt; for the US, please &lt;a class=&quot;Link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sothebys.com/en/docs/pdf/candidate-privacy-notice.pdf&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;click here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To view our &lt;strong&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice &lt;/strong&gt;for the UK, Hong Kong, France and Switzerland, please &lt;a class=&quot;Link&quot; href=&quot;https://www.sothebys.com/en/docs/pdf/final-v1-sothebys-recruitment-privacy-notice-uk-hk-france-and-switzerland-31-january-2022.pdf?locale=en&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;click here&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;strong&gt;.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;The Company is an equal opportunity employer and considers all applicants for employment without regard to race (including, without limitation, traits historically associated with race, such as natural hair, hair texture, and protective and treated or untreated hairstyles), color, creed, religion, sex, sexual orientation, marital or civil partnership/union status, national origin, age, disability, pregnancy, genetic predisposition, genetic information, reproductive health decision, sexual orientation, gender identity or expression, alienage or citizenship status, domestic violence victim status, military or veteran status, or any other characteristic protected by federal, state/province or local law. The Company complies with applicable state and local laws prohibiting discrimination in employment in every jurisdiction in which it operates.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Overview&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a hands-on Fullstack Web Developer to join our Web Apps team, in our Zürich office. In this role you will have the opportunity to drive development of new features, have a say in architecture and design decisions and have real impact across all the team’s projects.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The web apps team plays a central role at Auterion and owns the systems that add connectivity and remote interfaces for fleet management and operations. Our services are responsible for ingesting and analyzing flight telemetry data, managing and updating the fleet as well as integrating with other systems across the stack.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate is someone who’s a self-starter, can work independently, can work with ambiguity, can take decisions on their own and not be afraid to drive and push towards getting the project across the finish line.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities and Duties&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Take ownership and drive the development of new features across all the team’s web based projects&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver clean, readable and maintainable code&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate services between edge devices and our centralized services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Handle new feature discovery, prototyping and investigations&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Assist the Customer Success team in debugging and resolving customer issues&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor and analyze user usage patterns and other statistics&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Push initiatives to clean up, upgrade, and refactor existing services to reduce technical debt&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain and improve integrations with 3rd party services&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Qualifications and Skills&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4+ years of experience in a Fullstack web development or similar role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with the Node.js&amp;nbsp; ecosystem, development and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with the Typescript ecosystem, development and tooling&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong proficiency with modern SPAs (Vue.js ecosystem preferred)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Postgres/SQL (queries, transactions, views, indexes, triggers) as well as ORM systems (Prisma)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with Docker and container orchestration&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid experience with CI/CD pipelines (GoCD and GH Actions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with monitoring and observability tools (Datadog, Grafana)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python proficiency is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;CH/EU citizenship required&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Flexible working hours&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Stock Options&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generous holiday allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company pension plan&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Car parking&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced maternity &amp;amp; paternity leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mental health and wellbeing support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Auterion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are building the leading software platform for AI-powered autonomous systems for enterprise and government customers. Our team is supporting the most important missions and solving the most challenging problems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Auterion, we bring together the sharpest minds who love to solve the hardest problems. Join a vibrant team built on innovation, openness, and excellence, where you’ll be empowered to develop ideas, collaborate across all levels, and make an impact that matters.&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;div&gt;Für unseren Projektstandort in &lt;strong&gt;Visp&lt;/strong&gt; suchen wir einen Qualifizierungsingenieur (w/m/d) mit Eintrittstermin nach Absprache.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Deine Aufgaben&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bereitest Risikoanalysen sowie Qualifizierungen (DQ, IQ, OQ, PQ) projektgerecht vor, führst sie durch, dokumentierst und wertest sie aus.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du identifizierst Ursachen, bewertest fachlich und setzt Change- sowie Abweichungsmanagement (inkl. CAPA) um – inklusive deren Nachverfolgung und Überwachung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In der Erstellung von SOPs sowie in der Planung und Durchführung GMP-konformer Schulungen bringst Du Dein Know-how ein.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du unterstützt aktiv bei der Vorbereitung, Durchführung und Nachbereitung externer Inspektionen (Audits) im Bereich Qualifizierung.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Die Qualifizierung von Process Automation Systems (PAS) gehört ebenfalls zu Deinem Verantwortungsbereich.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div id=&quot;liquidDesignProfilePublication&quot; class=&quot;liquid-design-box&quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Dein Profil&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;div&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du hast ein Studium in Biotechnologie, Chemieingenieurwesen, Pharma-/Medizintechnik oder eine vergleichbare Ausbildung sowie mindestens 5 Jahre Erfahrung im Bereich CQV.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Qualifizierungsprozesse, Projektmanagement und Projektverantwortung sind Dir vertraut.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du arbeitest qualitätsorientiert, selbstständig und bringst ein hohes Maß an Eigeninitiative mit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mit Deinen sehr guten analytischen Fähigkeiten und Deiner strukturierten Arbeitsweise überzeugst Du im Projektalltag.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Du bist kommunikationsstark in Deutsch und Englisch, moderierst sicher und bist projektbezogen im In- und Ausland reisebereit.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;0&quot; data-end=&quot;15&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Über BakerHicks&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;17&quot; data-end=&quot;251&quot;&gt;Seit 1957 sind wir Vorreiter in den Bereichen Design, Engineering und Projektmanagement. Von der Beratung bis hin zum Bau und der Compliance unterstützen unsere multidisziplinären Design- und Ingenieurteams Unternehmen auf der ganzen Welt dabei, ihre Projekte auf die effizienteste, kostengünstigste und nachhaltigste Weise zu realisieren.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Überstunden voll kompensierbar&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Flexible Arbeitszeiten im Rahmen eines Gleitzeitmodells mit Blockzeiten&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Europäische Projekteinsätze möglich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Rabattangebote im Stücki Center Basel&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Umfassende Spesenregelung zur Aufwandserstattung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Mitarbeiter werben Mitarbeiter&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;2 verschiedene Pensionskassenlösungen (jährlich wechselbar)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;U-Abo für Pendler&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Flache Hierarchien&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Homeoffice&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Höchster Standard für Arbeitssicherheit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;25 Urlaubstage&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Volle Lohnzahlung im Krankheitsfall bis zum 30. Tag&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Weltweite Reiseversicherung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;UVG-Zusatzversicherung&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Zuschuss für Velopendler&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Teilzeitarbeit möglich&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;Möglichkeit zu unbezahltem Urlaub&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Reisetätigkeit&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Die Laufzeit unserer Projekte liegt meist zwischen 6 und 24 Monaten. Abhängig von Projekt und Projektphase ist der Einsatzort hauptsächlich der Projektstandort beim Kunden, wobei Mobiles Arbeiten von Zuhause in Absprache mit der Projektleitung teilweise möglich ist. Bei BakerHicks hat man so die Möglichkeit immer wieder bei unterschiedlichen Kunden mit unterschiedlichen Technologien zu arbeiten. Man lernt neue Städte kennen und ist dennoch am Wochenende immer zuhause.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Diversität &amp;amp; Inklusion&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;small&gt;Bei BakerHicks ist es uns wichtig, dass wir ein Umfeld schaffen, in dem sich alle zugehörig fühlen. Als Unternehmen sind wir in der glücklichen Lage, mit einem vielfältigen Team von Menschen mit den unterschiedlichsten Hintergründen und Erfahrungen zusammenzuarbeiten. Alle von uns sollten respektvolles und positives Verhalten erwarten können, das uns anspornt.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/small&gt;&lt;small&gt;Um sicherzustellen, dass wir immer ein offenes Ohr haben und ständig dazulernen, haben wir ein Team zusammengestellt, das uns dabei hilft, unsere Strategien für Diversität und Inklusion zu steuern.&lt;/small&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-start=&quot;311&quot; data-end=&quot;319&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.ch">Jobs in Switzerland</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;p&gt;The MongoDB Query Execution Team is hiring software engineers who want to join us in developing a high performing, reliable and modular distributed query system. Our engineers work on implementing and maintaining execution algorithms, building new query language features, tuning database performance, and more to power our customers&#39; critical workloads.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role can be based remotely in Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Position Expectations&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understand and improve current functionality of the MongoDB query engine&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute high quality C++ code and give and solicit feedback in code reviews&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify, design, implement, test, and support new features related to query performance and robustness, query language enhancements, diagnostics for query performance problems, and integration with other products and tools&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work constructively with peers to deliver excellent technical solutions&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Candidate Profile&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience in systems programming&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in databases and/or data management systems is a huge plus, but not a requirement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience building industrial-strength software&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solid computer science fundamentals, with strong competencies in data structures, algorithms, and software design/architecture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with large code bases, preferably in C++, C, Rust or a similar compiled language&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;B.Sc in Computer Science or similar field, or equivalent practical experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Interest in the theory and practice of database query engines. Hands-on experience or M.Sc./Ph.D in the domain is a plus&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Success Measures&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In three months you’ll have contributed to the development of a project slated for the next major version, as well as fixed a few bugs in a minor version of our latest stable release series&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In six months, you’ll have taken on code review responsibilities and are independently delivering complex functionality and squashing bugs independently&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;In twelve months, you’re leading the development of a new major feature and are helping to mentor new engineers on the team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About MongoDB&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is built for change, empowering our customers and our people to innovate at the speed of the market. We have redefined the data platform for the AI era, enabling builders to create, transform, and disrupt industries with software. MongoDB’s unified data platform, the most widely available, globally distributed data platform on the market, helps organizations modernize legacy workloads, embrace innovation, and unleash AI. Our cloud-native platform, MongoDB Atlas, is the only globally distributed, multi-cloud data platform and is available across AWS, Google Cloud, and Microsoft Azure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;With offices worldwide and over 67,000 customers, including 75% of the Fortune 100 and AI-native startups, relying on MongoDB for their most important applications, we’re powering the next era of software.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our compass at MongoDB is our &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/company&quot;&gt;Leadership Commitment,&lt;/a&gt; guiding how and why we make decisions, show up for each other, and win. It’s what makes us MongoDB.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;To drive the personal growth and business impact of our employees, we’re committed to developing a supportive and enriching culture for everyone. &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/company/blog/culture/employee-benefits-that-make-a-difference-at-mongodb&quot;&gt;From employee affinity groups, to fertility assistance and a generous parental leave policy&lt;/a&gt;, we value our employees’ wellbeing and want to support them along every step of their professional and personal journeys.&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.mongodb.com/blog/channel/culture&quot;&gt; Learn more about what it’s like to work at MongoDB&lt;/a&gt;, and help us make an impact on the world!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is committed to providing any necessary accommodations for individuals with disabilities within our application and interview process. To request an accommodation due to a disability, please inform your recruiter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;MongoDB is an equal opportunities employer.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Req ID: 2273491237&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;Our Purpose&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At SentinelOne, we are driven by a clear purpose: to give the advantage to those who secure our future. As AI reshapes how organizations build, operate, and innovate, the responsibility to protect them becomes more critical than ever. When you join SentinelOne, your work helps protect global enterprises, critical infrastructure, and the technologies shaping tomorrow. If you are motivated by meaningful challenges and want your impact to be real, measurable, and global, you will find purpose here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;About Us&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;SentinelOne is a company at the intersection of AI and security, pioneering a new operating model for cybersecurity. Our AI-native platform unifies protection across endpoint, cloud, identity, data, and AI systems to deliver autonomous detection and response with clarity and speed. By combining real-time analytics, intelligent automation, and a unified data foundation, we reduce noise, simplify complexity, and empower security teams to focus on what truly matters.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our teams are builders, problem-solvers, and innovators committed to shaping the future of security. If you are excited to solve hard problems alongside talented, mission-driven people, we invite you to help us build a safer future for humanity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What Are We Looking For?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for people who are relentlessly curious and committed to continuous learning. AI is reshaping every function across our business, and we enable every team member, regardless of role or level, to build fluency in AI tools and concepts. Those who thrive here actively seek out new solutions, experiment thoughtfully, and apply what they learn to drive better, faster, smarter outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;As a Sr. Solutions Engineer, you will be tasked with driving adoption, building strong partner relationships, and evangelizing our solutions across the region. You will focus on enabling the MSSP ecosystem, positioning and integrating SentinelOne&#39;s technology within partner technical offerings, selling to the managed partner base, conducting demos, delivering technical training, Proof of Values, assisting partners with pre and post sales activities, and assisting with escalations. Your role will be responsible for managing our MSSP partners, while cultivating long-term relationships with partners, and the SentinelOne field and Product/Engineering teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What will you do?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Primary responsibilities include:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with the Managed partner team to identify and qualify partnership opportunities, identify key partner technical objections, competition, and develop strategies to resolve technical blockers and scale the partner sales business&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bring feedback from partners and end customers to product management to improve the SentinelOne&#39;s solution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive follow-ups with partner resources to consistently deliver on messaging how SentinelOne adds value to the partner and their customers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and create go-to-market initiatives and offerings with SentinelOne partners&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop and execute technical training plans for partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own the technical relationship with SentinelOne&#39;s partners, and the coordination of additional technical resources.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver demonstrations and work hands-on with partners to demonstrate SentinelOne&#39;s value in the partner&#39;s environment or solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;What skills and knowledge should you bring?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Ideal candidates will have:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;10 Years+ in field, 5+ years Sales Engineering experience&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Exceptional track record of growing managed partner technical resources&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Strong background in building relationships with internal sales and product teams&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience presenting and delivering technical demos and sales values presentations to varying audiences from architects to C-level executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Technical experience/skills for the successful candidate:&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Experience working with CSPs, channel, MSP/MSSPs, GSIs, or alliances partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Ability to quickly learn, adapt, understand, and work with new emerging technologies, methodologies and solutions&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Fluent Dutch and English&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li class=&quot;li1&quot;&gt;Willingness to travel up to 50%&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Why SentinelOne?&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;AI is redefining how the world operates and rewriting the rules of security in real time, and SentinelOne was built for this moment. From day one, we architected an AI-native platform designed to operate at machine speed, not as an add-on to legacy systems but as the foundation itself. If you want to build where innovation and impact move together, this is that place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We invest in our Sentinels with comprehensive, competitive benefits designed to support you and your family:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equity &amp;amp; Rewards&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Restricted Stock Units (RSUs)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Stock Purchase Plan (ESPP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Time Off &amp;amp; Wellbeing&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Competitive leave benefits&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Gender-neutral parental leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Insurance &amp;amp; Financial Security&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Insurance and medical allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Pension scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work Perks &amp;amp; Flexibility&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Global home office allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Mobile phone reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Commuter or work-from-home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Wellness &amp;amp; Lifestyle&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Wellness benefit&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne is proud to be an Equal Employment Opportunity and Affirmative Action employer. We do not discriminate based upon race, religion, color, national origin, gender (including pregnancy, childbirth, or related medical conditions), sexual orientation, gender identity, gender expression, age, status as a protected veteran, status as an individual with a disability, or other applicable legally protected characteristics.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;SentinelOne participates in the E-Verify Program for all U.S. based roles.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our team’s mission is to align Vinted’s values, business goals, and Employer Value Proposition with our people’s real work experience. We translate Vinted’s truth into an inspiring story that attracts the right people, helps them grow, and instils them with pride.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll take an active role in Employer Branding at Vinted, with a particular focus on attracting engineering and data science talent. You’ll be based in Amsterdam, where our data science team is growing, but your work will reach candidates around the world.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Vinted has become an ecosystem with vertically integrated shipping and payments. This requires us to adapt our EVP to three very distinct brands and even more diversified hiring needs. Your job is to turn that into creative campaigns and stories that make specific audiences want to work here.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our next big focus is storytelling. Bringing the skills and challenges our teams face to life! What is a day in the life of a cybersecurity analyst? How does an anti-money laundering expert keep members’ wallets safe? What does it take to build the data science behind a marketplace used by millions? And what stories does each of our locations need?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Partnering with Talent Acquisition, engineering and data science leaders, People, Marketing, PR, Internal Comms, and Brand &amp;amp; Design, you’ll make sure those stories are told and that our presence is strong where we hire.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Be the guardian of Vinted’s employer brand, ensuring consistency and visibility across all platforms, like LinkedIn and Instagram&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong brand-building skills, with a clear vision of global vs local branding differentiation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use your sound understanding of branding and our editorial guidelines to write clear and engaging copy for things such as blogs, advertising campaigns, employer branding assets, email campaigns, event materials, online company profiles, as well as our careers pages.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create bespoke or support partnership events such as meetups, webinars, and networking events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Plan and run recruitment advertising, such as targeted LinkedIn campaigns and sponsorships with third-party publications and organisations, aimed at technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define where our global employer brand ends and local adaptation begins, so each location can tell its story while staying consistent with Vinted’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Shape our content calendar around hiring needs and our location strategy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Track what works, using results to sharpen the next activation, and share learnings with the wider Employer Branding team.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passionate about all things Employer Branding!&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You love storytelling: finding stories and having a keen eye for telling them in ways that stand out. You can show campaigns or activations you conceived and delivered.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Background in building and nurturing online and offline communities, and delivering innovative events and social media campaigns.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A clear view of global vs local branding, and experience working across markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adept at identifying new talent attraction channels, especially for engineering and data science audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable using data to set goals and judge what worked.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ability to juggle multiple projects with strong stakeholder management, and to work confidently with engineering and data science leaders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excited by change, a fast pace, and learning new ways of doing things.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent knowledge of social media and digital channels, including LinkedIn, Glassdoor, Indeed, and Meta.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent written and verbal English communication skills (English is Vinted’s official working language).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Digital mental and emotional health support and Employee Assistant Program (EAP)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€59.800&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€81.000 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Brief info about Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-sheets-root=&quot;1&quot;&gt;Our mission is to make second-hand the first choice, and we&#39;re looking for people who want to help us get there. Every day, we work together to help our members buy and sell pre-loved clothing and lifestyle items, giving each piece a second life – or even a third. &lt;br&gt;The Vinted Group is made up of three business units that support this mission:&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/marketplace&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Vinted Marketplace&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; is Europe’s leading platform for second-hand fashion and a go-to destination for all kinds of pre-loved items, with a growing range of categories. Our platform connects millions of members across 20+ markets, helping great items find a new life.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedgo&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Go&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; enhances the shipping experience with a vast network of over 500,000 pick-up and drop-off points, partnering with more than 60 carriers across Europe, with added services like item verification for peace of mind on high-value pieces.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://careers.vinted.com/vintedpay&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Vinted Pay&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/a&gt; is the newest part of the Vinted Group, dedicated to bringing secure, reliable payments to buyers and sellers across Europe. Seamlessly integrated into the Vinted app, it helps keep every transaction safe, efficient, and easy for our members.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Founded in 2008 in Lithuania, Vinted began as a way for friends to find new homes for clothes they no longer needed. In 2019, we became Lithuania&#39;s first unicorn! Today, our headquarters remain in Vilnius, and we&#39;ve grown with offices across Europe, supported by a team of over 2,000 people.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information about the position&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are looking for an Analytics Engineer to join our Revenue, Purchase &amp;amp; Order Analytics Engineering team.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The area sits at the heart of some of the most critical customer journeys and commercial systems across Vinted’s Marketplace Business Unit, spanning Revenue (pricing and advertising), Purchase (inquiries and checkout), and Orders (transactions and fulfilment). Together, these domains create a rich, high-volume, and deeply interconnected data ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Analytics Engineer, you’ll work at the intersection of data, engineering, and product, building trusted data products that power business and product decision-making across these domains.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;In this position, you’ll&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build scalable data products:&lt;/strong&gt; Design, develop, and evolve reliable, cost-efficient data products and pipelines that power analytics and machine learning use cases across the domains.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Build quality in by design:&lt;/strong&gt; Embed automated testing, validation, and quality controls throughout the data lifecycle to ensure data remains accurate, consistent, and complete.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strengthen observability:&lt;/strong&gt; Improve monitoring and alerting to detect and address issues before they impact downstream consumers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Own production reliability:&lt;/strong&gt; Take end-to-end ownership of production data systems, from investigating incidents and diagnosing root causes to implementing durable fixes that prevent recurrence and improve long-term resilience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;Who you’ll work with:&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Revenue, Purchase &amp;amp; Order Analytics Engineering: Join a talented and driven team of 7+ Analytics Engineers, working across interconnected domains and tackling complex, high-impact data challenges.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Data &amp;amp; Decision Scientists: Work closely with Data Scientists and Decision Scientists to build trusted data foundations that enable better business and product decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Engineering, Product &amp;amp; Business: Partner with Backend Engineering, Product, and Business teams to understand their needs, shape technical requirements, and translate them into well-designed, trusted data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The Analytics Engineering Guild: Be an active member of Vinted’s 40+ member AE Guild, benefiting from shared tooling, engineering standards, and knowledge across domains. You’ll also have opportunities to contribute to “side quests” that improve engineering practices, tooling, and reusable capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About you&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working as an Analytics Engineer, Data Engineer, or in a closely related data role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong SQL and data warehousing fundamentals, with the ability to build clean, performant, and maintainable data solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with dbt or a similar data transformation framework, building well-structured and tested data models.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working with a cloud data warehouse such as BigQuery, Snowflake, Redshift, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A solid understanding of data modelling principles and their application to real-world analytical problems.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Familiarity with workflow orchestration tools such as Airflow, Dagster, or similar.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfortable working with high-volume, business-critical data, balancing a high bar for quality and reliability with a pragmatic bias for action.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong written and verbal communication skills in English, with the ability to clearly explain technical concepts and trade-offs to both technical and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Work perks&amp;nbsp; &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The opportunity to benefit from our share options programme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days of paid annual leave&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Newest MacBook models&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidential Employee Assistance Program (EAP) for you and your family&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Frequent team-building events&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Home office support: we provide IT workstation equipment and a personal budget of up to €540 for home workplace furniture&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lunch benefit per working day&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A personal monthly budget for shopping on Vinted&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collective Defined Contribution Pension plan&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;NS Business Card for your commute to the office by public transport&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Company bike leasing scheme&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monthly budget for a flexible benefits platform&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work from Home allowance &lt;strong&gt;[[DELETE FOR Breda, Utrecht, Amsterdam Store]]&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A dog-friendly office&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Working at Vinted&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Workation policy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Better balance holidays with workdays by working remotely! Up to 90 days per year in the EU, of these, 21 days can be spent globally. For non-EU citizens, it&#39;s 21 days worldwide. This can be combined with time off for vacation or personal time.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Individual learning budget&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Each year, you’ll be given a learning budget (starting at €3,000), and a total of up to 10 working days over a 2-year period to support your personal and professional development.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Hybrid work&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Our hybrid model, with 2 recommended office days a week, gives you and your team the flexibility to decide if and when you want to work from home, and when to catch up in person.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal opportunity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We welcome applications from everybody, regardless of your background, identity, or life experiences. Job openings come with guides, not checklists. If you’re excited about a role, but don’t identify with every point in the ‘About you’ section, apply anyway – you might still be the perfect match!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;The annual gross salary range for this position excluding 8% holiday pay is:&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€53.900&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€72.900 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;blockquote&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Build automation that powers the heart of our customers’ most critical operations&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Schuberg Philis, we specialize in mission‑critical IT, partnering closely with our customers to keep their most essential systems running smoothly and securely with 100% responsibility. Our impact is driven by engineers who are deeply technical, automate everything, collaborate naturally, stay curious, take full end‑to‑end ownership, and understand the full stack - from application to core infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for engineers who flourish in automation‑first, mission‑critical environments and want to shape the platforms our customers rely on daily. In a self‑steering customer team, you design, build, run, and improve business‑critical systems across the full stack. You automate everything you touch, streamline pipelines, solve issues across the stack, and tune applications for performance. Working in a culture of real ownership, deep collaboration, and zero silos, where teams carry full responsibility for mission‑critical systems.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/&amp;nbsp;What you will do&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a Mission‑Critical Automation Engineer, you design, build, run, and improve platforms. You automate everything you touch, diagnose and resolve issues across the entire stack, collaborate closely with customer teams, and take full end‑to‑end ownership of stability, security, and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Your day-to-day includes:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building automation through scripting and configuration management tooling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Owning the full Plan–Build–Run lifecycle.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Solving multi‑layer issues across OS, network, DB, security, and apps.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Designing and executing controlled releases with Git and pipelines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Platform‑hardening practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;/&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-parastyle=&quot;No Spacing&quot;&gt;What you bring&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A strong automation mindset, with hands-on experience in advanced scripting and configuration management (e.g. Powershell, Ansible, DSC, Puppet, Chef).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on experience with Git and CI/CD practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience applying security principles in mission-critical environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficient in Infrastructure-as-Code tooling such as Terraform, Bicep, or ARM.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An ownership mentality, combined with curiosity and analytical thinking to understand and improve system behaviour end-to-end.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Understanding of networking, database fundamentals, release/deployment lifecycles, and applications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The following would be a plus:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Building and running containerized environments (Docker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Orchestrating platforms using Kubernetes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Operating in public or private cloud environments (Azure, AWS, or similar).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/ Who are you?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An engineer with strong specialization in a core technical domain, combined with a solid understanding of the broader system landscape.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Automation-driven, preferring code over manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A pragmatic problem solver who collaborates openly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A self-starter who thrives in a high-trust engineering culture.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Motivated by complex systems, customer impact, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;/&amp;nbsp;What can you expect?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with highly skilled engineers who focus on automation, security, and delivering real customer impact. We prioritize quality and ownership over billable hours (“freedom &amp;amp; responsibility”).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A culture that supports continuous growth through training, mentoring, and knowledge sharing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;High-quality offices, strong tech community involvement, and opportunities to experiment with new technologies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you’re an engineer in the Netherlands who defaults to automation, enjoys deep technical challenges, and drives real customer impact, we’d like to get in touch!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Everyone we work with and consider working with has a right to equal treatment. The hiring and appraisal process at Schuberg Philis is designed to be thorough and equitable, implementing fair payment, benefits, and opportunities across all demographics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;It is our desire to be a company that brings together multiple nationalities, cultures, religions, genders, abilities, and talents within and across our teams. We welcome colleagues from diverse backgrounds to join Schuberg Philis and actively support diversity and inclusion in the tech industry.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;At Catawiki, every day brings the extraordinary! Whether it’s &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Daniel Ricciardo’s Formula 1 Car&lt;/a&gt;, a &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/579-fossils&quot;&gt;Woolly Mammoth’s Skeleton&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/l/10035805&quot;&gt;Lady Gaga&#39;s Jumpsuit&lt;/a&gt; or &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/en/c/583-sports-memorabilia&quot;&gt;Usain Bolt’s running shoe&lt;/a&gt;, we encounter exceptional objects every day.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re a one-of-a-kind marketplace for buying and selling special objects. Each week, more than 100,000 unique items are auctioned, all carefully curated by our passionate in-house experts.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Having sold over 25 million unique objects, our mission is to become the world’s most popular destination for special objects. As a growing, diverse and sustainable scale-up, we proudly live by three core values. If these values resonate with you, we’d love to explore how you can join us.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Taking ownership and driving impact&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being open to change and feedback&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Being passionate about our mission and our customers.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your mission&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Every Product Manager at Catawiki owns a meaningful part of the customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In Search and Ranking, your mission is to help buyers find the special objects they care about. You will shape how search, ranking and personalisation work across the buyer journey, making discovery more relevant and helping more buyers find objects they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This is a broad product area. It brings together buyer needs, expert curation, marketplace priorities, search experiences and machine learning. You will identify the most important opportunities, set a clear direction and lead a cross functional team from insight to measurable customer and business impact.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The solution is not prescribed. You may improve search relevance, ranking, recommendations or personalisation, or explore new AI enabled ways to help buyers discover objects. What matters is that you solve a meaningful customer problem, measure the impact and scale what works.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will own the strategy, outcomes and execution for this area, working closely with Engineering, Design, Data Science, Marketing and Commercial teams.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you will do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and communicate a clear product vision, strategy and roadmap for Search and Ranking.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own measurable outcomes across search relevance, discovery, engagement and buyer conversion.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use behavioural data, customer research and commercial insight to identify and prioritise the biggest opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Turn ambiguous customer and business problems into clear hypotheses, prototypes and executable plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead initiatives from early discovery through experimentation, launch and scaling.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Define success metrics and build a rigorous experimentation agenda for search, ranking and personalisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work with machine learning engineers and data scientists to assess model quality, test new approaches and improve customer outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Improve the relevance of search results and recommendations across the buyer journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Integrate personalisation into the customer experience in ways that feel useful, coherent and trustworthy.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design, run and evaluate experiments, using positive, negative and inconclusive results to guide decisions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use AI and rapid prototyping to test ideas early, reduce development risk and accelerate learning.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create clarity, momentum and accountability across teams, including when priorities or incentives differ.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Communicate strategy, performance, tradeoffs and recommendations clearly to senior and C level stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Who you are&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Three qualities matter most in this role.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Outcome ownership&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You take responsibility for customer and business results, not only for delivering features. You stay with the problem, remove obstacles and change direction when the evidence calls for it.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Systems thinking&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You understand how search, ranking, recommendations, auction dynamics, expert curation and marketplace health influence one another. You make thoughtful decisions across the full buyer journey.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;em&gt;Experimental rigour&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You use data, research, prototypes and controlled experiments to make decisions. You learn from negative results and can distinguish meaningful progress from activity.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will also bring:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ol&gt;
&lt;li&gt;At least five years of product management experience, preferably in consumer ecommerce, marketplaces or another digital product at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience owning a broad product area or customer journey, rather than only individual features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience defining product strategy or roadmaps for search, ranking, recommendations, personalisation or other machine learning products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Confidence working with product metrics, experiments and commercial performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience designing, running and analysing A/B tests, including tests involving machine learning products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to turn uncertain opportunities into clear hypotheses, prototypes and plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A practical understanding of machine learning concepts and how models become useful product experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working closely with machine learning engineers and data scientists to develop and improve customer facing features.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comfort using AI tools to prototype quickly and explore customer experiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The ability to balance immediate commercial opportunities with longer term product and platform investments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Clear communication skills and the ability to influence senior leaders without relying on formal authority.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The pace, resilience and judgement to maintain a high standard of execution in an ambiguous environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ol&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Where you will be&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This role is based in Amsterdam. We offer a relocation package for people currently living outside the Netherlands.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;text text-align-left &quot;&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why You&#39;ll Love Working with Us&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Create a visible impact &lt;/strong&gt;by working at scale in a global organisation serving millions of customers across 80+ categories. In our flat structure, every role has a broad scope and directly impacts both our customers and the business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Learn and grow&lt;/strong&gt; through our Learning &amp;amp; Development initiatives, including clear development plans and mentorship programmes to support your career progression.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A culture of connection defines us&lt;/strong&gt;. We’re a passionate, diverse team of 800+ Catawikians representing 60+ nationalities. We foster an inclusive and queer-friendly environment where everyone is encouraged to bring their full self to work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Celebrate life’s moments with us. &lt;/strong&gt;You’ll receive a €100 Catavoucher when you join, a €50 Catavoucher on your birthday, and an extra day off each year to “Pursue Your Passion&lt;strong&gt;”&lt;/strong&gt;. We also offer additional leave for key work anniversaries and important life events. Benefits may vary by location.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our Offices and Way of Working&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Our vibrant offices in Amsterdam and Lisbon are designed to inspire collaboration. Most Catawikians operate in a hybrid setup, combining office-based and remote work, with a minimum of two days per week in the office, unless a role is explicitly stated as fully remote or fully office-based.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Interested?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Apply with an English CV and Cover Letter. By applying, you agree to &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.catawiki.com/conditions/applicant-privacy-policy.pdf&quot;&gt;Catawiki’s Applicant Privacy Policy.&lt;/a&gt; If you’re excited about this role but don’t meet every requirement, we still encourage you to apply anyway. You may be just the right candidate for this or other roles.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We may use artificial intelligence (AI) tools to support the review of your application. AI may help us assess how your experience matches the requirements of the role, but hiring decisions are always made by our recruitment team&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl">Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Sony Interactive Entertainment?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment isn’t just the Best Place to Play — it’s also the Best Place to Work. Sony Interactive Entertainment (SIE) is the company behind the PlayStation brand. As a subsidiary of Sony Group Corporation, we’re part of a proud legacy of innovation and excellence. SIE is a dynamic technology company, delivering cutting-edge hardware and network services to more than 100 million people and an entertainment leader, home to some of the most beloved and recognizable intellectual properties (IP) in the world. Our role at SIE is to create and nurture the experiences under the PlayStation brand, a name synonymous with entertainment excellence and creativity.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role overview:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The &lt;strong&gt;Director, Global Operations Excellence&lt;/strong&gt; will be responsible for leading Operational Excellence, standardisation, transformation, and continuous improvement across the Sony Interactive Entertainment global supply chain.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Working in a fast-paced, highly collaborative environment, this senior leader will oversee a team of Lean experts and Operational Excellence business standardisation specialists, ensuring SIE Operations continues to improve service quality, reduce waste, increase efficiency, and deliver consistent, high-performing operational practices across all regions.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reporting into Global Operations, this role will act as a key transformation leader across the Operations division, partnering with Logistics, Warehousing, Planning, Transportation, Finance, Procurement, Commercial, D2C, Customer Service, and regional Operations teams to drive measurable improvements across cost, service, process maturity, and customer experience.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the global Operations Excellence agenda for SIE, defining and executing a transformation roadmap focused on standardisation, Lean capability, service partner development, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee the Operations Lean Kaizen Office, driving Lean transformation activities across operational functions, including Kaizen events, value stream mapping, Gemba practices, waste reduction, cost improvement, and operational performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the development of global operational standards, ensuring SIE delivers a consistent, high-quality service experience to customers, retailers, commercial partners, and internal stakeholders across all markets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central point for translating commercial, customer, and business requirements into operational solutions, ensuring requests are clearly assessed, prioritized, and converted into realistic delivery plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global service partner development, including strategic tender activity, performance improvement, and commercial governance across warehousing 3PLs, control tower 4PLs, transportation partners, and other key Operations service providers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee centralised budgetary analysis across Operations, supporting visibility, control, and governance of OPEX and CAPEX activities across the global supply chain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generate data-driven insights into operational performance, ways of working, service quality, cost drivers, and customer impact, using these insights to shape strategic and continuous improvement initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key areas of focus:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Service Partner Development&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead global Operations tender activity across key warehousing 3PL, control tower 4PL, transportation, and logistics service partners.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Procurement, Finance, Legal, and regional Operations teams to ensure tender processes are commercially robust and operationally aligned.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support service partner strategy, performance management, governance, and continuous improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Provide budgetary oversight and centralised analysis of OPEX and CAPEX spend across Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to improve partner performance, cost efficiency, service delivery, and operational scalability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Lean Transformation: Operations Lean Kaizen Office&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead the Operations Lean Kaizen Office as the centre of excellence for Lean transformation across SIE Operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive Lean continuous improvement activities across all operational areas.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support weekly and monthly S&amp;amp;OE practices, ensuring continuous improvement is embedded into operational routines and decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead and support Kaizen events, value stream mapping, Gemba walks, process diagnostics, and waste reduction initiatives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Deliver measurable improvements in efficiency, cost, service quality, process flow, and operational performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build Lean capability across teams through coaching, standards, tools, and practical application.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Distribution Excellence&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Oversee global operational standardisation across distribution, warehousing, transportation, and fulfilment practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure SIE delivers one consistent, high level of operational service excellence to its global customer base.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop data-driven insights into how operational practices impact customers, commercial outcomes, cost, and service performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the central funnel point for commercial and customer requests, translating business needs into operational realities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify global best practices and scale them across regions, partners, and operational functions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Establish performance metrics, governance forums, and improvement roadmaps to drive accountability and progress.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we’re looking for:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;15+ years’ experience in Operations, Supply Chain, Logistics, Operational Excellence, Lean Transformation, or a related global leadership role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience leading Operational Excellence, Lean, continuous improvement, or business transformation programs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong understanding of global supply chain operations, including warehousing, transportation, distribution, 3PL/4PL management, and operational governance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience leading or supporting global tenders, service partner development, and supplier performance improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong financial acumen, with experience overseeing or analyzing OPEX, CAPEX, cost performance, and budgetary controls.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Demonstrated experience with Lean tools and methodologies, including Kaizen, value stream mapping, Gemba, standard work, waste reduction, and continuous improvement routines.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong ability to translate commercial and customer requirements into operational plans and scalable processes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent leadership skills, with experience managing high-performing teams of specialists or transformation experts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong analytical capability, with the ability to turn operational data into strategic insight and measurable improvement.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent stakeholder management skills across Operations, Finance, Procurement, Commercial, Customer Service, and regional leadership teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please note, Sony Interactive Entertainment conducts background checks at the offer stage for all new employees (which may include criminal background checks for some roles) and will need to process personal information to support these checks.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p class=&quot;p1&quot;&gt;Please refer to our&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.playstation.com/legal/careers-privacy-notice/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Candidate Privacy Notice&lt;/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;for more information about what personal information we collect, how we use it, who we share it with, and your data protection rights.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Equal Opportunity Statement:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony is an Equal Opportunity Employer. All persons will receive consideration for employment without regard to gender (including gender identity, gender expression and gender reassignment), race (including colour, nationality, ethnic or national origin), religion or belief, marital or civil partnership status, disability, age, sexual orientation, pregnancy, maternity or parental status, trade union membership or membership in any other legally protected category.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;We strive to create an inclusive environment, empower employees and embrace diversity. We encourage everyone to respond.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Sony Interactive Entertainment is a Fair Chance employer and qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records will be considered for employment.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;<p>Find more <a href="https://www.arbeitnow.nl/english-speaking-jobs">English Speaking Jobs in Netherlands</a> on Arbeitnow</a>

&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;Bloomreach is building the world’s premier&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;agentic platform for personalization&lt;/strong&gt;.We’re revolutionizing how businesses connect with their customers, building and deploying AI agents to personalize the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;&lt;em data-stringify-type=&quot;italic&quot;&gt;entire&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;customer journey.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;p-rich_text_list p-rich_text_list__bullet p-rich_text_list--nested&quot; data-stringify-type=&quot;unordered-list&quot; data-list-tree=&quot;true&quot; data-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re taking&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;autonomous search&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;mainstream, making product discovery more intuitive and conversational for customers, and more profitable for businesses.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We’re making&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;conversational shopping&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;a reality, connecting every shopper with tailored guidance and product expertise — available on demand, at every touchpoint in their journey.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;We&#39;re designing the future of&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;autonomous marketing&lt;/strong&gt;, taking the work out of workflows, and reclaiming the creative, strategic, and customer-first work marketers were always meant to do.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;p-rich_text_section&quot;&gt;And we&#39;re building all of that on the intelligence of a single AI engine —&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-stringify-type=&quot;bold&quot;&gt;Loomi &lt;/strong&gt;— so that personalization isn&#39;t only autonomous…it&#39;s also consistent.From retail to financial services, hospitality to gaming, businesses use Bloomreach to drive higher growth and lasting loyalty. We power personalization for more than 1,400 global brands, including American Eagle, Sonepar, and Pandora.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;section global-width&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;block&quot;&gt;
&lt;div class=&quot;block-wrapper description&quot;&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As we grow our EMEA team, we are seeking a &lt;strong&gt;Sales Development Representative&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;for the Nordics region, based in the&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;UK or NL.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;This role will require you to be in our London/Amsterdam office 3-4 times per week.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’ve asked our &lt;strong&gt;current sales people to tell us what they like about their job with Bloomreach,&lt;/strong&gt; and this is what they told us:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You sell a &lt;strong&gt;world-class product&lt;/strong&gt; that helps people&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Offering a cool thing &lt;strong&gt;you know works&lt;/strong&gt; (check our Success Stories)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re in touch with&lt;strong&gt; C-level clients and leading e-commerce businesses&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Having a job in the &lt;strong&gt;world’s most progressive industry&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can &lt;strong&gt;make a killing&lt;/strong&gt; (generous commission including on every signed deal)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;The sales role is the launchpad to the&lt;strong&gt; fastest career growth&lt;/strong&gt; at Bloomreach (both in terms of responsibilities and salary)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;As a salesperson, you have an&lt;strong&gt; incredible variety – vertically&lt;/strong&gt; (you can sell different elements of the platform depending on the client’s immediate needs) &lt;strong&gt;and horizontally&lt;/strong&gt; (you can choose your clients by industry – Fashion, Travel, Food Delivery, etc.)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Main goals of this role:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Generating new business leads, following up on MQLs &amp;amp; converting to SQLs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Cold calling potential customers and building relationships.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identifying customer needs and selling products accordingly.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working with weekly, monthly, quarterly sales targets and KPI’s.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Arranging meetings with clients and carrying out product demonstrations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Following up swiftly on sales enquiries and sending out information.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Working closely with other teams to develop new business.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Researching the market and identifying potential target customers (ICPs).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Attending industry events in order to generate business leads.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What we expect of you:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Previous new business experience ideally from a company in the same or similar industry is ideal&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven track record of bringing new business and a natural ability to drive sales&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Must be self-motivated, trustworthy and with a strong desire to succeed&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Well organised with experience using CRM systems (Salesforce, Hubspot, Salesloft)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Excellent time management skills, Positive attitude and “love of selling”&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A team attitude is absolutely necessary&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;A creativity over activity mentality when it comes to outbound prospecting&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-SF1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-pay-transparency&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-input&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;description&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The pay range actually offered will take into account a variety of potential factors considered in compensation, including but not limited to skills, qualifications, geographic location, accomplishments, experience, credentials, internal equity and business needs, and may vary from the range listed above.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;title&quot;&gt;Base Salary Range&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;pay-range&quot;&gt;&lt;span&gt;€37.632&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;divider&quot;&gt;&amp;mdash;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span&gt;€47.040 EUR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;h2 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 18pt;&quot;&gt;More things you&#39;ll like about Bloomreach:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Culture:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;A great deal of freedom and trust. At Bloomreach we don’t clock in and out, and we have neither corporate rules nor long approval processes. This freedom goes hand in hand with responsibility. We are interested in results from day one.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We have defined our &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.bloomreach.com/en/careers?utm_source=Job-Description-Footer&amp;amp;utm_medium=Job-Description&amp;amp;utm_content=Hyperlink-1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;5 values&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; and the 10 underlying key behaviors that we strongly believe in. We can only succeed if everyone lives these behaviors day to day. We&#39;ve embedded them in our processes like recruitment, onboarding, feedback, personal development, performance review and internal communication.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We believe in flexible working hours to accommodate your working style.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We work virtual-first with several Bloomreach Hubs available across three continents.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We organize company events to experience the global spirit of the company and get excited about what&#39;s ahead.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-stringify-indent=&quot;0&quot; data-stringify-border=&quot;0&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;We encourage and support our employees to engage in volunteering activities - every Bloomreacher can take 5 paid days off to volunteer*.&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.glassdoor.com/Overview/Working-at-Bloomreach-EI_IE442167.11,21.htm&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bloomreach Glassdoor page&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; elaborates on our stellar 4.7/5 rating. The &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.comparably.com/companies/bloomreach&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;Bloomreach Comparably page&lt;/a&gt; Culture score is even higher at 4.9/5&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Personal Development:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We have a People Development Program - participating in personal development workshops on various topics run by experts from inside the company. We are continuously developing &amp;amp; updating competency maps for select functions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our resident communication coach &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.linkedin.com/in/ivo-ve%C4%8De%C5%99a-2a94291/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Ivo Večeřa&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt; is available to help navigate work-related communications &amp;amp; decision-making challenges.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Our managers are strongly encouraged to participate in the Leader Development Program to develop in the areas we consider essential for any leader. The program includes regular comprehensive feedback, consultations with a coach and follow-up check-ins.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Bloomreachers utilize the $1,500 professional education budget on an annual basis to purchase education products (books, courses, certifications, etc.)*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Well-being:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;The Employee Assistance Program -- with counselors -- is available for non-work-related challenges.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Subscription to Calm - sleep and meditation app.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We organize ‘DisConnect’ days where Bloomreachers globally enjoy one additional day off each quarter, allowing us to unwind together and focus on activities away from the screen with our loved ones.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We facilitate sports, yoga, and meditation opportunities for each other.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Extended parental leave up to 26 calendar weeks for Primary Caregivers.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3 style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Restricted Stock Units or Stock Options are granted depending on a team member’s role, seniority, and location.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Everyone gets to participate in the company&#39;s success through the company performance bonus.*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We offer an employee referral bonus of up to $3,000!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;
&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We reward &amp;amp; celebrate work anniversaries -- Bloomversaries!*&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;(*Subject to employment type. Interns are exempt from marked benefits, usually for the first 6 months.)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Excited? Join us and transform the future of commerce experiences!&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;If this position doesn&#39;t suit you, but you know someone who might be a great fit, share it - we will be very grateful!&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align: justify;&quot;&gt;&lt;em&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;Any unsolicited resumes/candidate profiles submitted through our website or to personal email accounts of employees of Bloomreach are considered property of Bloomreach and are not subject to payment of agency fees.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
