&lt;p&gt;We are looking for a Senior Visual Designer (m/f/d) to further enhance our brand identity and visual communication. We&#39;re seeking a versatile and strategic thinker who can develop impactful visual assets while ensuring consistency across all touchpoints. You’ll be the go-to person for building our branding, marketing materials, technical infographics.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your responsibilities:&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Branding &amp;amp; Corporate Identity&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain compelling Brand Guide that reflects companies’ values, vision, and technological innovation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure visual consistency across logos, color schemes, typography, and brand elements – for digital platforms, marketing materials, and product interfaces.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Marketing &amp;amp; Communication Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design marketing materials including brochures, flyers, merchandising, and digital assets.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce high-impact presentation materials, such as corporate presentations and visuals for webpages, to support business development, sales, and internal communications.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Render prototypes and products with realistic 3D visuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create engaging infographics, schematics, and technical outlines of hardware products to communicate complex ideas clearly and support with creating product manuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Office/Showroom/Booth Design&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the design and visualization of office environments that reflect the Agile Robots’ companies brand, ensuring functional and aesthetic layouts for team and visitor experience.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Design showroom and demo visuals that showcase brands in a compelling way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Contribute to the development of exhibition booth designs that are functional, engaging, and on-brand.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Your Profile:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Degree in Graphic Design, Visual Communication, Industrial Design, or a related field (or equivalent experience).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of professional experience in branding, graphic design, and visual storytelling – ideally within the technology, robotics, or industrial sectors.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven experience as a Senior Graphic/Visual Designer, with portfolio showcasing branding, marketing materials, slide decks, and product visualizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Expert in Adobe Creative Suite (Photoshop, Illustrator, InDesign) and Figma or equivalents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience in 3D rendering and technical drawings, with proficiency in tools such as SolidWorks and Rhino for creating high-quality product visualizations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Strong conceptual thinker – able to create scalable, meaningful designs.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Hands-on and versatile – comfortable working on both high-level branding and practical, day-to-day design tasks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Great communication and collaboration skills – you will work with UI, Marketing, Sales, and Product teams.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Adaptable and proactive – thrives in a fast-paced, cross-functional environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
